# Two-particle Lennard-Jones teaching model; no integration or constraint fix.
units metal
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 20
create_box 1 box
create_atoms 1 single 8 10 10
create_atoms 1 single 11.8 10 10
mass 1 39.9623831237
pair_style lj/cut 8
pair_coeff 1 1 0.0103 3.4
